From da8d070c8c60dc59345680df3e0a61d656e3d8bf Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SquadronConsult <michael@defense-dna.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 04:32:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/5] hw/misc: add i.MX 8M Plus GPC and SRC models

The GPC completes power-up/down requests at once and acknowledges bus
handshakes, so TF-A and Linux power domain code no longer spin on an
unimplemented device. The SRC starts secondary A53 cores at the entry
point firmware stores in SRC_GPR1..8 when their reset bit is released,
which TF-A uses for PSCI CPU_ON.
